+
+R1 is resolved. The visible 2008 label now says “2008 base with recorded additions”; its short label identifies a study view. The correspondence warning and `projection_calendar_horizon` separate the 2008 book target, recorded later additions and dataset revision, and explicitly establish no single frozen or complete-current cutoff. The plan preserves later appointments and requires their temporal qualification in reader identity, Study, unavailable responses and print. The examples are expressly non-exhaustive.
+
