+Teresa's existing source note starts at line 64779, with its date statement at 64782. The newly pinned official USCCB page agrees; SHA-256 `2a6c333466c67bc982db1c5c9b2b1792058e6504752ed92a115e606efe0b60aa`, 50,539 bytes. Its separate 4 August 2026 approval concerns the Liturgy of the Hours. It does not make a 2026 Missal version or establish calendar completeness through any year. No demonstrable common latest update horizon is established by these positive examples.
